 "notes": "Its heavy is a thrust rather than a cut, and its two-handed heavy carries hyperarmour the class otherwise has nowhere — the one straight sword that will trade with an axe.\n\nLineage: garrison — Imperial issue. The control against which every other weapon in the game is a deviation.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 31.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
